Subject: [PATCH 1/2] victory: DLSS Frame Generation through Streamline (ported
 from rtx2060-full)

FidelityFX capture wrapper, depth/motion-vector scout from the title's render
targets, C++ Streamline bridge (manual hooking, frame-based tagging). Off unless
